    "raw_text": "Mako, Culver to Bring Attention to Organ Donation\nOctober 2, 2026\nWHAT:\nRep. Zach Mako (R-Lehigh/Northampton) and Sen. Lynda Schlegel Culver (R-27) will help bring attention to organ donation by leading the Steps for Life Advocacy Walk. It will begin with a brief press conference and then a short walk around the Capitol grounds.\nWHO:\nMako, Culver, and Gift of Life Donor Program leaders and a transplant recipient.\nWHEN:\nMonday, Oct. 5, 10 a.m.\nWHERE:\nMain Capitol Rotunda, Harrisburg\n.\nLIVE WEBSTREAMING:\nTune in at\nRepMako.com\n.\nMedia contact:\nTracy Polovick, 717.260.6358,\ntpolovick@pahousegop.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
